This repository contains no vLLM source. The engine is a pinned pip wheel
installed into a virtualenv by the contributor; vLLM is Apache-2.0 licensed by
its own authors (vllm-project/vllm) and stays under that license wherever it
is installed. The patches under patches/ are contributed under this MIT license.
